Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.81,0:00:06.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It just felt like he felt a bit guilty as well{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德米纳尔好像还有些愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:09.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the fans that came out and watched,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对那些来到现场观赛的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:10.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but nothing that could be done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但也实在无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:13.46,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}22{\fs68}岁到{\fs78}39{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:17.30,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}座奖杯 连接着{\fs78}17{\fs68}年的北京记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:21.81,TL,,0,0,0,,首战{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 击败哈内斯库
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.81,0:00:22.83,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}场比赛后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:25.62,TL,,0,0,0,,德约第一次捧起中网奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:36.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That'll do it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:41.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic reigns supreme in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇在北京登顶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:46.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's his third title of the season,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他的赛季第三冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:49.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the 14th of his young career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是他年轻生涯的第十四冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}His third title this year,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他的年度第三冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:01:00.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the 14th of his stellar career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是精彩生涯的第十四冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:07.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and a nice sum of US$500,000 to go with it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N同时收获五十万美元奖金
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:10.96,TL,,0,0,0,,费什在第二轮赛前退赛 不计胜场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:14.51,TL,,0,0,0,,这一届{\fs78}4{\fs68}场胜利 总账来到九胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.97,0:01:34.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Back-to-back championship runs in 2009-2010.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二零零九 二零一零 连续两届夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:38.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic, your champion, as he defeats David Ferrer,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇击败费雷尔 成为冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:42.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}straight sets, 6-2, 6-4, at the China Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在中网直落两盘 六比二 六比四
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:46.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He knows what it's like to hold the trophy aloft.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他很熟悉举起奖杯的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.97,0:01:48.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He did so last year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N去年 他就曾这样捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:51.24,TL,,0,0,0,,第三次参赛 第三次夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:54.26,TL,,0,0,0,,中网{\fs78}14{\fs68}场 全部获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:07.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:11.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he has done it again,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他再次做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:13.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the 14th time in as many matches.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十四场比赛 十四次获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic prevails,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:19.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and he is a three-time champion at the China Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第三次成为中网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:21.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You heard him say xie xie,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你听到他说“谢谢”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:23.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}which is thank you in Mandarin.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用的是普通话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:26.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That again just going to make it more endearing{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这也会更讨人喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:27.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to the Chinese fans here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对这里的中国球迷来说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:35.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Djokovic defends his title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇成功卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:40.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a record fourth trophy in Beijing for Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他在北京拿到创纪录的第四座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:43.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's still unbeaten at this tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他在这项赛事依然保持不败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:45.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nineteen successive victories.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N连续十九场获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:50.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it was a well-earned victory this afternoon against Rafael Nadal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天他战胜纳达尔 赢得实至名归
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:52.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Serbian was the better man.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位塞尔维亚人表现更胜一筹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:57.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And now the celebrations can begin in earnest.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在可以尽情庆祝了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:59.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Djokovic is the king in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇是北京之王
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:02.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He wins 6-3, 6-4.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他以六比三 六比四获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:05.06,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对面是纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:06.62,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:08.69,TL,,0,0,0,,德约拿到第四杯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:15.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 击败伯蒂奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:19.08,TL,,0,0,0,,北京的胜场数 来到{\fs78}24{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:27.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Djokovic makes it five in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约第五次在北京夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:34.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}His unbeaten streak in the Chinese capital goes on.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他在北京的不败纪录仍在延续
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:40.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The champion in Beijing for 2014,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二零一四年的北京冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:43.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.98,0:03:45.51,TL,,0,0,0,,再胜纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:49.40,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}次参加 {\fs78}6{\fs68}次夺冠 {\fs78}29{\fs68}场不败
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's six of the best in Beijing,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N六度在北京夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:59.30,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}simply the best, Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N实至名归的最佳 德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:04.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Champion here for a sixth time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他在这里第六次捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:08.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Congratulations to Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N恭喜德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:10.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Please take a picture with the presenters.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N请与颁奖嘉宾合影
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another wonderful performance from him.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他又一次献上精彩表现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:17.72,TL,,0,0,0,,这张榜算的是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:20.67,TL,,0,0,0,,从赛事首战起 从未输过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:24.10,TL,,0,0,0,,缺席年份不打断 只计实际比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:27.48,TL,,0,0,0,,同一个起点 塞莱斯澳网{\fs78}33{\fs68}胜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:29.40,TL,,0,0,0,,纳达尔法网{\fs78}31{\fs68}胜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:32.28,TL,,0,0,0,,德约的北京 还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:35.97,TL,,0,0,0,,相隔{\fs78}11{\fs68}年 德约再次回到北京
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:39.59,TL,,0,0,0,,胜场总账 从{\fs78}29{\fs68}重新出发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:41.70,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮对布云朝克特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:43.66,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛对兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:46.81,TL,,0,0,0,,他都是先丢一盘 再赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:57.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic keeps his streak alive here in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约延续了在北京的不败纪录
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.93,0:05:01.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}31 and 0 now for Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在 德约三十一胜 零负
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.81,0:05:08.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}At times it didn't look like it was going to happen today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天有些时候 真让人捏了一把汗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:17.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's done it again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他又一次做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.31,0:05:20.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:25.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There's something about this place,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这座球场有种特别的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:30.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and there is something about this man.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个男人也有特别之处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:34.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The unbeaten record here in Beijing continues.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他在北京的不败纪录仍在延续
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:40.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Breathe it in.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好好感受这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:43.63,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 梅德韦杰夫击球打中观众
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:45.22,TL,,0,0,0,,被取消资格
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:47.14,TL,,0,0,0,,德约进入决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Can you believe it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你能相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:52.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just a flurry of errors from Medvedev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅德韦杰夫突然连续失误
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:58.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a brilliant combination from Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约这套组合打得太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:01.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, can you believe it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这下真让人难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:07.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After the most extraordinary level in this match,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N本场双方打出了极高水平
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:09.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it has ended on a Medvedev default.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛因梅德韦杰夫被判失格而结束
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:17.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, no real protest from Daniil Medvedev,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅德韦杰夫没有真正提出抗议
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:19.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but it's hard to argue with the decision{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这项裁决实在难以争辩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:23.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Mohamed Lahyani and the ATP supervisor there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N由拉亚尼和现场{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}监督作出
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.70,0:06:25.70,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛首盘{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.91,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘德米纳尔保发后 因伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.91,0:06:32.00,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛结束 遗憾也留在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:44.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic moves to within a set{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇距离冠军只差一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}of a seventh Beijing title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那将是他的第七座北京冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:48.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Puts away the forehand, but he's not looking good, is he?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他拿下正手 但看上去不太舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:50.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think he might be done here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想 他可能坚持不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:53.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Big shake of the head from de Minaur.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德米纳尔重重地摇了摇头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You could just tell he wasn't in a good place.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看得出 他的身体状况很不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:57.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, can you believe it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N天啊 你能相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.73,0:07:01.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean that is just heartbreaking for de Minaur.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这对德米纳尔实在太令人心碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:03.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So disappointing for the fans.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N球迷们也感到非常遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:11.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But it is a seventh Beijing title{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不过 这仍是第七座北京冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:12.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Novak Djokovic,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N属于德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:18.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who remains unbeaten in the Chinese capital.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他在北京依然保持不败
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:20.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}34 and 0.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三十四胜 零负
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:23.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This trophy means much more, much more{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这座奖杯的意义远远不止于此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:26.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}than one trophy, one tournament for all of us,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对我们来说 远不止一杯 一站赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:27.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so very, very happy for that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以我非常 非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:30.85,TL,,0,0,0,,第一杯到第七杯 走过{\fs78}17{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.85,0:07:34.21,TL,,0,0,0,,北京的奖杯故事 还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:36.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It just felt like he felt a bit guilty as well{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德米纳尔好像还有些愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:39.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the fans that came out and watched,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对那些来到现场观赛的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:40.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but nothing that could be done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但也实在无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:41.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}次捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:44.87,TL,,0,0,0,,你最难忘德约的哪一年中网？
